SUMMARY:Arturo Vaca
LOCATION:The Stand Up Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Arturo Vaca is bringing the kind of comedy that turns everyday 
 
disasters into standing ovations. A San Fernando Valley native\, Arturos ex
 
plosive storytelling\, wild act-outs\, and brutally relatable observations 
 
have earned him spots at legendary clubs like The Comedy Store\, Hollywood 
 
Improv\, and Laugh Factoryand even put him on the radar at Netflix Is A Jok
 
e. Expect fast-paced laughs\, unpredictable energy\, and stories thatll hav
 
e you texting your friends\, You wont believe what this guy just said. Snag
 
 your tickets nowbecause hearing everyone else quote Arturos jokes the next
 
 day is way less fun than being there when they land. *********************
 
